<codeline lineno="63"><highlight class="stringliteral"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>A<sp/>wildcard<sp/>for<sp/>the<sp/>hostname<sp/>is<sp/>also<sp/>supported<sp/>and<sp/>will<sp/>bind<sp/>to<sp/>both</highlight></codeline>
