<codeline lineno="72"><highlight class="stringliteral"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="73"><highlight class="stringliteral"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>This<sp/>will<sp/>disable<sp/>IPv4<sp/>socket<sp/>support.<sp/>This<sp/>affects<sp/>wildcard<sp/>matching</highlight></codeline>
<codeline lineno="74"><highlight class="stringliteral"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>when<sp/>generating<sp/>the<sp/>list<sp/>of<sp/>sockets.</highlight></codeline>
