<codeline lineno="87"><highlight class="stringliteral"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Path<sp/>of<sp/>Unix<sp/>socket.<sp/>If<sp/>a<sp/>socket<sp/>path<sp/>is<sp/>specified,<sp/>a<sp/>Unix<sp/>domain</highlight></codeline>
