<codeline lineno="149"><highlight class="stringliteral"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>Default<sp/>is<sp/>120.<sp/>&apos;Inactive&apos;<sp/>is<sp/>defined<sp/>as<sp/>&apos;has<sp/>received<sp/>no<sp/>data</highlight></codeline>
